 *  gnirsTest   -   Implements the OCS 'test' command 
 *  mechMotor   -    Translate mechanism number to motor number
 *  moveMech   -   Move a mechanism 
 *  parkMech   -   Mark operation to be 'park'. 
 *  scanStatusTask   -   Provide status information to EPICS
 *  setGratingRot   -   Grating rotation to encoder position 
 *  setPositionReq   -   Set a position request for movement. 
 *  setSimulation   -   Sets simulation mode 
 *  valid   -   Validate a request for positioning from the EPICS layer 
 *  validGratingWavelength   -   Convert wavelength and order to angle. 
 *  validPreferredWavelength   -   Convert wavelength to angle. 
 *  wfsBusReset   -   Resets the VME bus 
