/*
 *+
 * FUNCTION NAME:
 * mechMotor
 *
 * INVOCATION:
 * mechMotor(mech)
 *
 * PARAMETERS: (">" input, "!" modified, "<" output)
 * (>) mech (int)       which mechanism is to be referenced
 *
 * FUNCTION VALUE:
 * (int) Returns the motor number that corresponds to a given mechanism.
 *
 * PURPOSE:
 * Translate from a mechanism to a motor number.
 *
 * DESCRIPTION:
 * (see PURPOSE)
 *
 * EXTERNAL VARIABLES:
 *
 *
 * PRIOR REQUIREMENTS:
 *
 *
 * DEFICIENCIES:
 *
 *
 * HISTORY:
 * Jul 1, 2001      Initial Version                 (rwolff@noao.edu)
 *
